<title>TURKEY: Turkish Airlines borrows $123.5 mln to buy A340.</title>
<headline>Turkish Airlines borrows $123.5 mln to buy A340.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state airline THY has borrowed $123.5 million from a consortium of three banks to finance its fifth Airbus A340, the Turkish treasury said on Friday.</p>
<p>The treasury, which guaranteed the loan, said Credit Agricole, Abnaque National De Paris and Dresdner Bank co-arranged the loan.</p>
<p>The agreement for the loan was signed in Paris on Thursday, it said. It did not give other details.</p>
<p>--Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
